OL,5,G2000 The World In A Painting: Vermeer's
OL,6,G     Hat
OL,7,     FBased on Vermeer's Hat by Timothy
OL,8,     FBrook, this documentary offers a
OL,9,     Fnew way of understanding the
OL,10,     Finternational world we live in
OL,11,     Fthrough the lens of a 17th-century
OL,12,     Fpainting.
OL,13,G2115 Art Traffickers: Treasures Stolen
OL,14,G     from the Tombs
OL,15,     FThrough a combination of
OL,16,     Finterviews and studio
OL,17,     Freconstructions, recount the
OL,18,     Fgripping stories behind those who
OL,19,     Fhave excavated and stolen
OL,20,     Fmasterpieces. (3 of 4)
